{"id":"626333","name":"车前草肉丁南瓜包","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/626333/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"车前草","amount":"1把"},{"name":"蒸南瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"2g"}],"sub":[{"name":"温水","amount":"50g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"南瓜里放温水和莲藕。","img":"images/626333/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/626333/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放面粉，搅成絮状。","img":"images/626333/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成面团，放温暖出发酵。","img":"images/626333/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"车前草摘洗干净。","img":"images/626333/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"肥三瘦七的猪肉切丁，放碗里。","img":"images/626333/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放生抽和老抽。","img":"images/626333/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放放食盐。","img":"images/626333/step_8.jpeg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放食用油。","img":"images/626333/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/626333/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/626333/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"把野菜焯水，变色即可。","img":"images/626333/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"捞出过冷水，切末。","img":"images/626333/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放肉丁里。","img":"images/626333/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/626333/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"面团发酵好。","img":"images/626333/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"取出来揉光排气，搓长条。","img":"images/626333/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"揪成剂子。","img":"images/626333/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/626333/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"包包子。","img":"images/626333/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"全部包好。","img":"images/626333/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"放温暖出二次发酵。","img":"images/626333/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"发好的包子入蒸锅。","img":"images/626333/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"盖盖子，大火烧开。","img":"images/626333/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"中火蒸25分钟，关火焖5分钟即可。","img":"images/626333/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/626333/step_26.jpg"}],"tips"